      "event_url": "https://www.oaklandcountydemocrats.org/events/knock-out-the-vote-with-abdul-el-sayed",
      "description": "Join us for a Canvass Rally with Dr. Abdul El-Sayed in Southfield! Doors open at 4:00 PM with the event beginning promptly at 5:00 PM. Location will be provided upon RSVP. Abdul El-Sayed is running for the U.S. Senate because life in Michigan has become too hard—and too expensive. After a successful career of making government work for Michiganders, he wants to take his vision to Washington and make the United States Senate work for working people. This is it: the final stretch. In the final days of the General Election, Abdul for US Senate is throwing open the doors with GOTV Rallies and Canvass Launches—and every single one of us has a role to play. Campaigns aren't won on TV. They're won on porches, on sidewalks, in conversations between neighbors who believe Michigan deserves better. Show up. Bring a friend. Knock some doors. Because when we talk to our communities, we win. Walking shoes required; we've got ground to cover! We look forward to seeing you on November 1st! RSVP HERE: https://www.mobilize.us/fb/event/1070833/"
    },
